{"id": "d328ccce-8379-41b8-815f-2f9b85df03e9", "slug": "axiom-engineered-presence", "title": "Axiom - Engineered Presence", "description": "Axiom Engineered Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Axiom - Engineered Presence\"\ndescription: \"Axiom Engineered Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4F46E5\"\n  secondary: \"#191C21\"\n  accent: \"#6366F1\"\n  background: \"#191C21\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Bebas Neue\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Axiom - Engineered Presence\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 87; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, navigation, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nAxiom Engineered Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAxiom Connect Architecting digital experiences with unyielding precision and refined structural integrity. axiom 145 City Road London, EC1V 1AZ +44 20 7123 4567 hello@axiom.inc ELENA ROSTOVA Managing Partner\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architecting digital experiences with unyielding precision and refined structural integrity..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4F46E5, secondary #191C21, accent #6366F1, background #191C21, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Bebas Neue for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Axiom - Engineered Presence</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            primary: '#4f46e5',\n                            dark: '#050505',\n                            card: '#f8f9fa'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-bebas-neue\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-bebas-neue\">.font-bebas-neue { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif !important; }</style><link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-poppins\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-poppins\">.font-poppins { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"antialiased text-slate-900 bg-brand-dark min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-brand-primary selection:text-white\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n    <!-- Structural Frame Borders and Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-6 border border-white/[0.06] z-0 pointer-events-none rounded-3xl mix-blend-screen transition-all duration-1000\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 bottom-0 left-12 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 bottom-0 right-12 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- ThreeJS Background Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" style=\"position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; z-index: -10; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.6;\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- SVG Animated Background Lines -->\n    <svg style=\"position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: -5; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.25;\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n        <path id=\"anim-path\" d=\"M0,100 L30,50 L70,50 L100,0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#line-grad)\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 200; stroke-dashoffset: 200; transition: stroke-dashoffset 4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);\"></path>\n        <defs>\n            <linearGradient id=\"line-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop>\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" stop-opacity=\"1\"></stop>\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop>\n            </linearGradient>\n        </defs>\n    </svg>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Overlay -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full p-6 lg:p-12 flex justify-between items-center z-50 mix-blend-difference text-white\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 slide-fade-in\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); transition: all 0.8s ease 0.2s;\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <path d=\"M4 6L12 11L20 6\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M4 18V6\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M20 18V6\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M12 11V21\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"font-medium text-sm tracking-tight font-poppins\">Axiom</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Border Gradient Premium Pill with Beautiful sm shadow -->\n        <div class=\"slide-fade-in relative rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary/50 via-white/30 to-brand-primary/50 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); transition: all 0.8s ease 0.4s;\">\n            <div class=\"bg-brand-dark/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer hover:bg-black transition-colors\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/90 font-poppins\">Connect</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Container (Isometric Viewport) -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"perspective: 2000px;\">\n        \n        <!-- Overlay Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-end p-8 lg:p-24 z-40\">\n            <h1 class=\"split-words text-white text-3xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight max-w-2xl leading-tight mix-blend-difference font-bebas-neue\">\n                Architecting digital experiences with unyielding precision and refined structural integrity.\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3D Transform Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"reveal-3d relative w-full max-w-4xl aspect-video flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0; filter: blur(20px); transform: rotateX(65deg) rotateZ(-30deg) translateZ(-100px) scale(0.9); transition: all 2s cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1) 0.1s;\">\n            \n            <!-- Pedestal Block (Simulated) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bg-brand-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]\" style=\"width: 300%; height: 300%; top: 20%; left: -100%; transform: translateZ(-20px); border-radius: 24px;\">\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Fake depth shadow for pedestal -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bg-[#312e81]\" style=\"width: 300%; height: 100vh; top: 100%; left: -100%; transform: rotateX(-90deg); transform-origin: top;\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- The Card (Primary Subject) with Gradient Border & Beautiful lg shadow -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-primary/60 via-white/20 to-brand-primary/10 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\" style=\"width: 28rem; height: 16rem; transform: translateZ(0px);\">\n                \n                <div class=\"relative bg-brand-card flex flex-col justify-between w-full h-full rounded-2xl p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <!-- Card Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between w-full relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Logo Vector Replication -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"block\">\n                                <path d=\"M4 18V9L9 12L14 9V18\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"></path>\n                                <path d=\"M4 9L9 14L14 9\" fill=\"#4f46e5\" opacity=\"0.8\"></path>\n                                <path d=\"M14 9L20 18H14\" fill=\"#3730a3\" opacity=\"0.9\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-poppins\">axiom</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card Body/Footer Content -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end w-full relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Left Column -->\n                        <div class=\"space-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal font-poppins\">\n                                145 City Road<br>\n                                London, EC1V 1AZ\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Column -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end text-right space-y-8\">\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal font-poppins\">\n                                +44 20 7123 4567<br>\n                                hello@axiom.inc\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 uppercase font-poppins\">ELENA ROSTOVA</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-normal mt-0.5 font-poppins\">Managing Partner</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Subtle card texture overlay -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-5 mix-blend-multiply\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.65%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            \n            // --- 1. Text Animation Setup (Word by Word) ---\n            const splitElements = document.querySelectorAll('.split-words');\n            splitElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n                const words = text.split(/\\s+/); // Handle multiple spaces safely\n                words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                    if (!word) return;\n                    const span = document.createElement('span');\n                    span.innerText = word;\n                    span.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    span.style.opacity = '0';\n                    span.style.filter = 'blur(8px)';\n                    span.style.transform = 'translateY(15px) translateZ(0)';\n                    span.style.transition = `all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) ${index * 0.08 + 0.5}s`;\n                    el.appendChild(span);\n                    // Explicitly append a text node containing a space to fix word wrapping and spacing issues\n                    el.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n                });\n            });\n\n            // --- 2. Intersection Observer for Animations ---\n            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                entries.forEach(entry => {\n                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                        \n                        // Reveal 3D Setup\n                        if (entry.target.classList.contains('reveal-3d')) {\n                            entry.target.style.opacity = '1';\n                            entry.target.style.filter = 'blur(0px)';\n                            entry.target.style.transform = 'rotateX(55deg) rotateZ(-40deg) translateZ(0px) scale(1)';\n                            \n                            // Trigger SVG line animation\n                            setTimeout(() => {\n                                document.getElementById('anim-path').style.strokeDashoffset = '0';\n                            }, 500);\n                        }\n\n                        // Reveal Text Words\n                        if (entry.target.classList.contains('split-words')) {\n                            const spans = entry.target.querySelectorAll('span');\n                            spans.forEach(span => {\n                                span.style.opacity = '1';\n                                span.style.filter = 'blur(0px)';\n                                span.style.transform = 'translateY(0) translateZ(0)';\n                            });\n                        }\n\n                        // Reveal UI elements\n                        if (entry.target.classList.contains('slide-fade-in')) {\n                             entry.target.style.opacity = '1';\n                             entry.target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                        }\n                    }\n                });\n            }, { threshold: 0.1 });\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-3d, .split-words, .slide-fade-in').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n\n            // --- 3. ThreeJS Background (Subtle Dust/Atmosphere) ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            \n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 350;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 15;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            \n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.025,\n                color: '#4f46e5',\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.35,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            camera.position.z = 5;\n\n            // Subtle rotation animation\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.0002;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n            \n            // Subtle Parallax on Mouse Move for the 3D container\n            const container3d = document.querySelector('.reveal-3d');\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const xAxis = (window.innerWidth / 2 - e.pageX) / 100;\n                const yAxis = (window.innerHeight / 2 - e.pageY) / 100;\n                \n                // Only apply parallax after the initial entrance animation settles\n                if (container3d.style.opacity === '1') {\n                    container3d.style.transform = `rotateX(${55 + yAxis}deg) rotateZ(${-40 + xAxis}deg) translateZ(0px) scale(1)`;\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "axiom-engineered-presence.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/axiom-engineered-presence.jpg", "source_name": "axiom-engineered-presence-DESIGN.md", "views": 111, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:10:48.829646+00:00"}